# Request one matched raw image and CameraInfo pair.
---
bool success

# Identifies the exposure a successful request produced: the stamp and frame of
# the image and CameraInfo pair published immediately before this reply. Left
# empty when success is false. The caller's own future is the correlation, so
# unlike a separate completion topic this can never be attributed to a later
# request after an earlier one was abandoned.
std_msgs/Header header

# The request was accepted and one matched pair was published.
uint8 OK=0
# The source transport has not completed warm-up yet.
uint8 WARMING=1
# Another request owns the current exposure.
uint8 BUSY=2
# A timed-out request is draining possible late frames.
uint8 DRAINING=3
# The current request timed out; the node is now draining late frames.
uint8 TIMEOUT=4
uint8 reason
string message
